  "title": "Mastino Napoletano Urn for Dog Ashes, Personalized Memorial with Relief, Pet’s Name and Quote, Custom urn for dog&#39;s ashes",
  "description": "Summary:\n- Handmade wooden urn for pet ashes, solid and durable, personalized with engraved quote, pet&#39;s name and dates of birth and death.\n- CUSTOMIZATION: send us details including your pet&#39;s name and dates of birth and death, so we can personalize your urn. Sentence on the wooden plate can also be changed.\n- Urn&#39;s volume is 9,5 litres (600 cubic inches), suitable for pets up to 95 kilograms (210 pounds). The outside dimensions are: 21 x 29 x 22 cm (8.3 x 11.4 x 8.7 inches).\n- Removable lid and brass handles make the urn convenient to use. Wreath decorations and classic urn style make it timeless.\n- The lid is not seal. It has to be glued with any all purpose glue to keep it tight.\n- All of our items are shipped with courier, so we can be sure that the order reaches you in the shortest possible time!\n\nPERSONALIZED URNS COLLECTION with RELIEF\n\nWhen the saddest day comes we know that there is nothing that can ease your pain. We are here to help you to say the last goodbye to your precious dog. We offer a collection of urns with different dog breeds. Give us your dog&#39;s name, date of birth and death and we will engrave them and make your own, personal memorial.\n\nWooden urn is made of birch plywood, which makes it durable and lasting. The urn has brass handles and wreath shaped decorations. Engraving is applied to birch plywood. The dog bust is made of cold cast bronze. Urns classic style makes it ageless.\nThis custom made urn will make your pet feel your love forever.\n\nAll of the additional costs like import charges and customs, that are not charged by Etsy, might be charged by the courier or post office. The buyer is fully responsible for covering the costs.",
